ike PICARD/Synchromesh, KG completion with type constraints, error analysis in IE)\n   - Is the positioning against existing work fair and accurate?\n\n4. **Writing Quality**\n   - Clarity of exposition\n   - Organization and flow\n   - Are negative results presented honestly?\n   - Title/abstract alignment with actual contributions\n\n5. **Weaknesses** (numbered, specific)\n\n6. **Questions for Authors** (numbered)\n\n7. **Minor Issues**\n\n8. **Score** (1-6) with justification\n\nFormat your review as a structured reviewer report. Be rigorous but fair. Consider whether this paper, as positioned (empirical study + targeted solution), meets the bar for a top ML venue."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WcCktKqfHnSynte6FdQBx5","session_id":"8810d8ca-95df-4cbf-a0e9-6349587d15d7","uuid":"581709e1-d204-4142-8033-04cb68069265","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:59:24.142Z"}
