{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PGoQ3tB2hiw5fBqbz95LG8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 10\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 主目标调整为 EMNLP 2026 ARR (5/25), AAAI 2027 为后备\\\\n  rationale: 用户明确指出 EMNLP ARR 5/25 时间不紧、不要保守、资源会给够。12 天 AI 团队速度足够：Phase 0 (1-2天) →\\\\n    Phase 1 compiler (2-3天) → Phase 2 experiments (2-3天) → Paper (2-3天)。禁止 fallback\\\\n    思维，冲最高目标。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: SciERC Phase 0 结果确认 GO — domain_range violation rate 15.4%，3× 超阈值\\\\n  rationale: 'SciERC 全量 test set (551 sentences, 1724 triples): domain_range_violation_rate\\\\n    = 15.4%，远超 5% go/no-go 阈值。违规分布极不均匀 (Feature-of 33.5%, Compare 42.4% vs Used-for\\\\n    0.76%)，支持\\\\\\\"特定 relation types 需要 decoding-time enforcement\\\\\\\"的论文 claim。DocRED dry-run\\\\n    (37 docs) 同样显示 14.4%。两个数据集均为 GO 信号，MVP 核心假设得到强验证。等 schema-informed prompt 结果确认\\\\n    prompt 级干预不足以解决问题后正式宣布 MVP 通过。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_violation_rate\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: domain_range_violation_rate=15.4%, go_nogo=GO\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段，立即启动 Phase 2 constrained decoding 实验\\\\n  rationale: Phase 0 三个实验完成：SciERC 15.4%/5.78%, DocRED 18.7% domain_range violation\\\\n    rate。两个数据集均远超 5% 阈值，核心假设得到强验证。Phase 1 compiler 代码就绪（36 tests 通过），Phase 2 脚本就绪（S1\\\\n    路径可用，S2 bug 修复中）。cuda:1 空闲，立即启动 Phase 2 SciERC grammar_only/semantic_only/full_s1\\\\n    实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_violation_rate\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: SciERC DR=15.4%, GO\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_scierc_schema\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: SciERC DR=5.78%, prompt insufficient\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_violation_rate_docred\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DocRED DR=18.7%, GO\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：grammar+semantic (full_s1) DR↓94% F1 neutral，两层约束协同效应成立\\\\n  rationale: _v2 干净数据 551 样本全量结果：full_s1 DR=0.93%（baseline 15.37%，↓94%），R-F1 微升 +0.0013。grammar\\\\n    单独消除 RV/ET，semantic 单独降 DR 24%，组合后 94%——超加性效应。论文核心 claim 站住。早期污染数据 semantic_only\\\\n    DR=16.43% 已修正为 11.65%。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV/ET=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, F1=0.0836\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：Full S1 DR↓94% F1无损，CF violation↑124x 作为已知 tradeoff\\\\n    待 S2 对比后决定处理策略\\\\n  rationale: v2 干净数据 551/551 全量验证，Reviewer PASS。Grammar+Semantic 协同效应成立，ablation story\\\\n    清晰。CF violation（0.08%→9.9%）是约束副作用，需等 S2 结果判断是在论文中作为 limitation 还是加 CF 约束修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%, RV=1.39%, ET=0.4%, RF1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV=0%, ET=0%, RF1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%, RV=1.51%, ET=0.4%, RF1=0.0815\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, RV=0%, ET=0%, RF1=0.0836, CF=9.9%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：Full S1 DR -94% 且 F1 无损，CF violation 上升为已知 limitation\\\\n  rationale: v2 干净数据全量（551/551）结果经 Reviewer PASS 验证：Full S1 DR 15.37%→0.93%（↓94%），R-F1\\\\n    +0.13pp，ET/RV→0%。Ablation story 清晰（grammar 管格式、semantic 管语义、双层协同）。CF violation\\\\n    从 0.08%→9.9% 是已知副作用，需在论文中正面报告并论述与 DR 的性质差异。Semantic-only DR=11.65% 说明两层是 multiplicative\\\\n    关系。决定推进 DocRED Phase 2 跨数据集验证 + 等 S2 对比。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=15.37%, R-F1=0.0823\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_grammar_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=14.84%, RV/ET=0%, F1持平\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: DR=11.65%, F1-0.08pp\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: core_result\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, R-F1=0.0836(+0.13pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_phase0_docred_schema\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: DocRED DR=12.8%(-32%), 验证prompt级不足\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 02:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: S2 降级为架构 ablation，S1 为主推策略；标题去掉 \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 改 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: S2 全量结果(551/551)确认：DR 0.97%(vs S1 0.93%)、CF 8.03%(vs S1 9.9%，降幅不显著)、R-F1\\\\n    8.03%(vs S1 8.36%)。S2 在所有指标上均未优于 S1，两通道分离未能解决 CF 问题。CF 是 per-relation 独立 type\\\\n    enforcement 的固有限制，非架构可解。S2 定位从\\\\\\\"CF 解决方案\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"架构灵活性展示\\\\\\\"，论文中放 ablation/appendix。标题\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 与 0.93% 残余不符，改为 \\\\\\\"Near-Complete\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: DR=0.97%, CF=8.03%, R-F1=8.03% — no advantage over S1\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: DR=0.93%, CF=9.9%, R-F1=8.36%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 补跑 DocRED semantic_only 完成跨数据集全消融；论文写作提前至 DocRED 分析完成后立即启动\\\\n  rationale: 'SciERC 有 5 路消融但 DocRED 只有 grammar_only + full_s1，缺 semantic_only。Claim\\\\n    3 (enabling dependency) 在 DocRED 上的证据链不完整——审稿人必问\\\\\\\"为何 DocRED 不做 semantic_only 对比\\\\\\\"。DocRED\\\\n    约束更紧(avg 5.68 valid pairs)，semantic_only 预期效果更差，反而是 enabling dependency 的更强证据。论文写作从\\\\n    5/19 提前到 DocRED 分析完成后(~5/16)，DocRED semantic_only 与写作并行，结果 patch 进去。grammar-semantic\\\\n    交互 bug (invariant: semantic mask ⊆ grammar allowed set) 需写入 Method section 作为\\\\n    resolution protocol。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_grammar_only\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_docred_full_s1\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_semantic_only\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: DR↓24% but ET/RV not eliminated\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: Llama-3.1-8B cross-model 验证升级为 should-have，SciERC-only (unconstrained +\\\\n    full_s1)\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 实测 DocRED 实验进度远超预期（May 15 早间全部完成 vs 原估 May 17-18），多出 2-3 天 buffer。单模型是最可能的\\\\n    EMNLP reviewer 批评 (C5)，2 组 SciERC 实验 4-6 GPU 小时即可完成，风险可控。constraint compiler 声称\\\\n    model-agnostic，跨模型验证是最直接的证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_full_s1\\\\n    role: baseline_same_model\\\\n    result: DR↓94% F1无损\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_scierc_unconstrained\\\\n    role: baseline_same_model\\\\n    result: DR 15.37%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D008\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6314, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01E5qdXDrgD7MQ7cvXgf66Ae","session_id":"8810d8ca-95df-4cbf-a0e9-6349587d15d7","uuid":"94db3f19-824e-4f8b-9edc-7daeef3d82ca","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:59:30.250Z"}
