schema 恢复，--resume）\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 12 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 13\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1767, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WcCktKqfHnSynte6FdQBx5","session_id":"8810d8ca-95df-4cbf-a0e9-6349587d15d7","uuid":"ebffdfbe-27f3-42c6-bba4-4c508e051c70","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:59:33.320Z"}
