{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ggz2MUEGFqNguMtE4nq185","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# schema_semantic_constrained_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 06:19 UTC | 更新原因: Reviewer 实测时间线修正 + D009 cross-model 升级为 should-have\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nSchema-semantic constrained decoding for information extraction：利用 ontology schema 在 LLM 解码时施加 grammar + semantic 双层约束，近乎消除 domain/range 违规且不损失 F1。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n**阶段**: Research — Phase 2 SciERC 完成，DocRED 跨数据集验证中 + 论文写作并行\\\\n**投稿目标**: EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25 | 内部初稿 DDL May 19（距今 5 天）\\\\n\\\\n**SciERC Phase 2 核心结果**（全部完成）：\\\\n- Full S1 (grammar+semantic): DR 15.37%→0.93% (↓94%), R-F1 +0.13pp, ET/RV→0% ← **主推策略**\\\\n- Full S2 (two-pass): 降级为 ablation (D007)\\\\n- Grammar only / Semantic only: 两层互补确认\\\\n\\\\n**DocRED Phase 2**（4 实验消融）：\\\\n- grammar_only: RUNNING cuda:0 (653/998, ~20s/doc, 预计 May 14 ~17:00 UTC)\\\\n- full_s1: RUNNING cuda:1 (568/998, 预计 May 14 ~16:30 UTC)\\\\n- semantic_only + unconstrained: QUEUED → 预计 May 14 晚至 May 15 凌晨完成\\\\n- **全部 4 实验预计 May 15 早间就绪**（Reviewer 实测，比初估提前 2-3 天）\\\\n\\\\n**Cross-model 验证** (D009, should-have)：\\\\n- Llama-3.1-8B SciERC: unconstrained + full_s1（2 组，4-6 GPU·h）\\\\n- 安排在 DocRED 完成后 (May 15)，预计 May 15-16 完成\\\\n\\\\n**论文写作进度**：\\\\n- ✅ §1 Intro, §4 Method, §4.x Composition, §5 SciERC, §6 RelWork, Tables×4, Figs×3\\\\n- ✅ §2 Background（3 subsections, ~580 words）\\\\n- ✅ §3 Violation Landscape（4 subsections, per-relation + prompt insufficiency）\\\\n- ✅ .bib 全部完成（RelWork 9篇 + 新论文 9篇，WebSearch 验证）\\\\n- ✅ Abstract 初稿（~231 words, DocRED placeholder）\\\\n- ✅ §7 Conclusion 初稿（~400 words, DocRED placeholder）\\\\n- ❌ §5 DocRED subsection（等实验结果 → 填 placeholder）\\\\n- ❌ §5 Cross-model（等 Llama 结果）\\\\n- May 18-19: 全文校对 + 一致性 → May 19 内部稿\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] DocRED grammar_only + full_s1 完成 → 立即提交 QUEUED 两个\\\\n- [ ] §2 Background + §3 Violation Landscape 完成\\\\n- [ ] .bib 完成 + 引用验证\\\\n- [ ] DocRED 4 实验全部完成 → §5 DocRED subsection\\\\n- [ ] Llama-3.1-8B SciERC 环境准备 + 2 组实验 (D009)\\\\n- [ ] §5 Cross-model subsection\\\\n- [ ] Abstract + §7 Conclusion\\\\n- [ ] experiment_plan.yaml 补全（低优先级，提交前）\\\\n- [ ] 全文校对 + 一致性检查\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: westd-16980 cuda:0 + cuda:1 (2× GPU)\\\\n- 当前: 2/2 满载（grammar_only + full_s1）\\\\n- 预计释放: May 14 ~17:00 UTC → 立即接 QUEUED\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-14 | Llama-3.1-8B cross-model 验证升级为 should-have，SciERC- | phase2_scierc_full_s1, phase2_scierc_unconstrained |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-14 | 补跑 DocRED semantic_only 完成跨数据集全消融；论文写作提前至 DocRED 分 | phase2_docred_grammar_only, phase2_docred_full_s1, phase2_scierc_semantic_only |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-14 | S2 降级为架构 ablation，S1 为主推策略；标题去掉 \\\\\\\"Guaranteed\\\\\\\" 改 \\\\\\\"Ne | phase2_scierc_full_s2, phase2_scierc_full_s1 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-14 | Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：Full S1 DR -94% 且 F1 无损，CF v | phase2_scierc_unconstrained, phase2_scierc_grammar_only, phase2_scierc_semantic_only, phase2_scierc_full_s1, mvp_phase0_docred_schema |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-14 | Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：Full S1 DR↓94% F1无损，CF viola | phase2_scierc_unconstrained, phase2_scierc_grammar_only, phase2_scierc_semantic_only, phase2_scierc_full_s1 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-14 | Phase 2 SciERC 核心结果确认：grammar+semantic (full_s1) D | phase2_scierc_unconstrained, phase2_scierc_grammar_only, phase2_scierc_semantic_only, phase2_scierc_full_s1 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-13 | MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段，立即启动 Phase 2 constrained dec | mvp_phase0_violation_rate, mvp_phase0_scierc_schema, mvp_phase0_violation_rate_docred |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-13 | SciERC Phase 0 结果确认 GO — domain_range violation ra | mvp_phase0_violation_rate |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-13 | 主目标调整为 EMNLP